sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant AC as AuthController / AuthService
    participant DB as MySQL
    participant SEC as Security filter chain
    U->>FE: username and password
    FE->>AC: POST /auth/login
    AC->>DB: find user by username
    DB-->>AC: user, password hash
    alt wrong password
        AC-->>FE: 401 problem+json
    else account pending or disabled
        AC-->>FE: 403 ACCOUNT_PENDING / ACCOUNT_DISABLED
    else ok
        AC-->>FE: 200 accessToken (15 min), refreshToken (7 days), user
    end
    FE->>SEC: GET /resources, Authorization: Bearer access token
    SEC->>SEC: check signature, expiry, token_use = access, roles
    opt token expired
        SEC-->>FE: 401
        FE->>AC: POST /auth/refresh {refreshToken}
        AC->>DB: reload user, still active?
        AC-->>FE: 200 new token pair
        FE->>SEC: repeat the call with the new token
    end
    SEC-->>FE: 200 resources
